        "text_C6ETac": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most International packages are delivered within 2-8 weeks, however, some packages have been delayed by an additional 2-6 weeks. To minimize delays, be sure to provide an accurate shipping address and telephone number.<br/><br/>Please also be aware that delays in customs are becoming increasingly common. Packages may take longer to get to international destinations, and unfortunately, we cannot control or prevent this type of delay. WE ARE NOT RESPONSIBLE for any packages lost, stolen or delayed by the shipping or postal service. </p>",
