    "faq_jDHwMK": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_TynDNH": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When will my order arrive?",
            "text": "<p>All shipments are sent by DHL Global Mail, and you can track your shipment via the DHL Global Mail tracking system at <a href=\"https://webtrack.dhlglobalmail.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://webtrack.dhlglobalmail.com/</a> </p><p>For more up-to-date information regarding shipping times and delays, we recommend visiting our <a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support-shipping-information\" target=\"_self\">Shipping Information page</a>.  </p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_GAkeUw": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will I have to pay any additional customs, duties, or VAT fees when I receive my order?",
            "text": "<p>Depending on your country, it is possible that you will be charged one or more of these fees when you receive your order.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_XVGCjt": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does the 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee work?",
            "text": "<p>We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, our team is here to assist you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br/><br/>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please contact us at returns@thephotostick.com, and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and issue a refund. For more information regarding our return process, check out our <a href=\"/pages/support-return-and-refund-process\" title=\"Support - Return and Refund Process\">Returns and Refunds page</a>.</p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "question_7nYLPn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "I accidentally ordered the wrong version of ThePhotoStick. What should I do?",
            "text": "<p>That's no problem! </p><p>To cancel or make changes to your current order, please email our Customer Support Team at <a href=\"mailto:support@thephotostick.com\" target=\"_blank\">support@thephotostick.com</a> or simply click the gray chat icon at the bottom of your screen to begin chatting with a live support agent.</p><p>To ensure a smooth and quick process, please have your order confirmation number, found in your confirmation email, ready. </p>",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
